  "question": {
    "text": "The temperature at which the kinetic energy of oxygen molecules becomes double than its value at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is",
